The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for '''Tiger Shark''' is {{Green|500}}, resulting in a catch chance of {{Chance|10.05%|1|9.95|sea creatures}} in [[Sea Creatures#Shark|Fishing Festival Sea Creatures]] pool with all Sea Creatures unlocked. Currently there are no modifiers that can be used to increase it.

